## Rows skipped (with reason)
- a#19 (Hangul slug in 008/009 `url:`, percent-encoded Korean Wix path in 005) — ACCEPTED-pt:
  frontmatter `url:` is canonical source metadata, not rendered. No Hangul exists outside `url:`
  values (verified by scan).
- b#8 (`lang=jpn` on the Invest Taiwan link in 011) — ACCEPTED-pt marks it "fixed mechanically —
  skip"; the link still carries `lang=jpn` in this worktree, but the hard rules forbid changing
  links, so it was left untouched. FLAGGED FOR THE SUPERVISOR: the mechanical fix did not land
  in this branch.
- a#49 / b#28 (ROC-year glosses) — applied only PARTIALLY. "ano 109 (2020)" was rejected: adding
  the Gregorian year injects a target-only digit and the checker turns `numbers` to WARN.
  Instead the year is explained in words with no new digit: "ano 109 do calendário da República
  (民國)". Likewise the case-number form "número 644" was kept instead of "n.º 644" — "n.º" makes
  the checker fail to match the Korean source's 제644호 (tested: it produced a new WARN). Noted
  per R6/"prefer the form the checker accepts".

## Systemic sweeps (pattern → instances changed)
- French "le seul fait" calque `[AaOo] só <noun>` → `o/a simples <noun>` (plus 3 hand-fixes to
  `único` where the sense was "the only ..."): 48 instances across 001, 002, 003, 004, 007, 010,
  011, 014, 016, 017. Zero remain (regex-verified).
- "em/Em contrapartida" used for "by contrast" → "pelo contrário": 8 instances (004, 008, 011 ×2,
  017 ×4, 018). Remaining "contrapartida" occurrences are the correct sense (consideration).
- 經濟部投資審議司 unified to "Departamento de Revisão dos Investimentos do Ministério da Economia":
  8 instances (001, 011 ×2, 013 ×2, 017 ×2, 018 ×3 — replacing both "Departamento de Exame" and
  018's "Comissão dos investimentos").
- "dispensar/dispensada/dispensa" for 授與/提供 training (French *dispenser*) → "ministrar/
  ministrada/formação ministrada": 7 instances in 014.
- "de entrada" for French *d'emblée* → "à partida": 3 instances (014 ×2, 018). The remaining
  "de entrada" hits are the correct sense (capital contribution / entry structure).
- "de forma de conjunto" → "em conjunto": 4 instances (001, 007 ×3).
- 戶政機關/戶政事務所 "conservatório do estado civil" → "conservatória do registo civil": 9 in 007.
- 信託 "fideicomisso"/"fidúcia" → "trust (信託)": 2 in 007, 5 in 016.
- 會面交往 "relações pessoais" → "regime de visitas (e de contacto)": 8 in 007.
- 損害賠償 "postos de indemnização / postos de prejuízo / postos legalmente excluídos" → "rubricas":
  8 instances (010 ×5, 016 ×3, plus 003's "todos os postos da reclamação" → "rubricas").
- 戶籍 "registo de estado civil" → "registo de agregado familiar": 4 in 016.
- "Q&A" left in headings → removed: 005, 013.
- Blog/availability CTAs ("deixe um comentário", "contacte-nos a qualquer momento", "dirigir-se a
  qualquer momento a um advogado") → "escreva através da página Contacto; não é prometido um
  prazo de resposta": 4 instances (003, 005, 013, 015). Emoji 😊 removed from 013.
- R2 Korea-centric framing generalized: 001 (Country-specific note + caveat added), 004 (parent
  company, "do lado da Coreia" ×2, home-country tax law, caveat added), 005 (hiring FAQ + bank),
  007 (family, child relocation), 008 (×3), 009 (×1). Korea kept only as a labelled example.
- R3 advertising softening: 003 ×4 (max compensation, 3/4/6-month sentences, suspended sentence),
  005, 008 (anecdote + "não tiveram tanta sorte"), 013 ×2 ("com êxito", "não é excessivamente
